          "start": 1187
        },
        "quote": "(e) “Accommodations broker” means any business which maintains an inventory of two or more rooms in one or more locations which are offered for pay to a person or persons for not more than 28 consecutive days. (C.O. 120 § 1, 1-5-21.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-16:block:6#text",
